{
  "$comment": [
    "Every reason the harness model proxy stamps on x-mcpjam-proxy-refusal, with",
    "the status it answers its own refusals with. Mirrored by the Inspector",
    "(shared/harness-proxy-refusal-reasons.json); pinned in convex/lib/mirrors.json.",
    "retry: the x-should-retry the proxy sends. class: how the Inspector's eval",
    "infra classifier reads the refusal (null: not an infrastructure failure, the",
    "trial keeps counting)."
  ],
